msgid ""
"Blog posts use Article; all other post types and pages use WebPage. Includes "
"headline, description, inLanguage, url, datePublished, dateModified, image, "
"and publisher."
msgstr ""
"بلاگ پوسٹس کو Article استعمال کریں؛ دیگر تمام پوسٹ اقسام اور صفحات WebPage "
